# SecPassGen Pro - Codebase Reference

## File Structure
```
/app
  /api/generate/route.ts - Password generation API
  /api/stats/route.ts - Statistics API
  layout.tsx - Root layout with metadata
  page.tsx - Main page with Lenis + Framer Motion
  globals.css - Monochrome theme + animations
  
/components
  PasswordGenerator.tsx - Main generator UI
  PasswordHistory.tsx - Encrypted history sidebar
  AnimatedBackground.tsx - Visual effects
  CustomCheckbox.tsx - Styled checkboxes
  StrengthMeter.tsx - Password strength display
  
/lib
  db.ts - NeonDB utilities (hash, store, verify)
  passwordHistory.ts - AES-256 encryption for local storage
  
/public
  logo.png - App logo
  og-image.png - Social media image
```

## Key Patterns

### Password Generation
```typescript
// Uses crypto.getRandomValues() for true randomness
const array = new Uint32Array(length);
crypto.getRandomValues(array);
```

### Uniqueness Check
```typescript
// SHA-256 hash before DB check
const hash = await hashPassword(password);
const isUnique = await isPasswordUnique(hash);
```

### History Encryption
```typescript
// Device-specific key from browser fingerprint
const key = await getEncryptionKey();
const encrypted = await crypto.subtle.encrypt({name: 'AES-GCM', iv}, key, data);
```

### Animations
```typescript
// Framer Motion with custom easing
<motion.div
  initial={{ y: 20, opacity: 0 }}
  animate={{ y: 0, opacity: 1 }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.8, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}
/>
```

## Database Schema
```sql
CREATE TABLE generated_passwords (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  password_hash TEXT UNIQUE,
  length INTEGER,
  charset_config JSONB,
  created_at TIMESTAMP,
  ip_hash TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE generation_stats (
  total_generated BIGINT,
  last_updated TIMESTAMP
);
```

## API Contracts

### POST /api/generate
Request: `{length, count, includeUppercase, includeLowercase, includeNumbers, includeSymbols}`
Response: `{passwords: string[], count: number, message: string}`

### GET /api/stats
Response: `{totalGenerated: number, lastUpdated: string}`

## Security Measures
- Parameterized queries (SQL injection prevention)
- SHA-256 password hashing
- AES-256 history encryption
- IP hashing for privacy
- No plain text storage
- HTTPS enforced

## Performance
- Database indexes on password_hash, created_at
- Connection pooling (NeonDB)
- Client-side caching (localStorage)
- Optimistic UI updates
- Lazy loading components

## Monochrome Theme
Pure black (#000) / white (#FFF) with opacity variations
- Dark: bg-black, text-white
- Light: bg-white, text-black
- Borders: white/10 or black/10
- Hover: white/20 or black/20
